ts PhD students, providing advanced educational tools to complement the existing doctoral supervision. Alongside their research at the DBE, students are offered a wide range of courses and trainings to create a unique career profile based on their needs and interests, which will then be an asset on the job market.\nAs of August 1, 2025, we enter a transition phase towards a more ambitious project by integrating our doctoral program into the Graduate School Medical and Health Science.\nDo you have specific questions about the PhD Program offered at the DBE?\nThen contact our coordination office!\nContact us\nWhether you're currently studying in our department or considering joining the ranks of our PhD students, visit the relevant page by clicking on the tabs below:\nEnrolled before 01.08.2025\nEnrolled after 01.08.2025\nLooking for a PhD\nQuick Links\n\u00bb University of Basel\n\u00bb University Hospital Basel\n\u00bb University Children\u2019s Hospital\n\u00bb Current Vacancies\n\u00bb Internal Resources\n\u00bb Emergency Contacts\nSocial Media\nLinkedin\nInstagram\nYouTube\n\u00a9 University of Basel\nPrivacy Policy\nDisclaimer\nCookies\nTo top", "links": [["How do I activate JavaScript in this web browser?", "https://www.enable-javascript.com/en/"], ["Contacts", "https://dbe.unibas.ch/en/about-us/contact-and-directions/contact-by-domain/"], ["Documents", "https://dbe.unibas.ch/en/documents/"], ["Annual Reports", "https://dbe.unibas.ch/en/events-news/material-about-the-dbe/"], ["Event Registration", "https://dbe-events.dbe.unibas.ch"], ["Search", "javascript:void(0)"], ["", "https://dbe.unibas.ch/en/"], ["Department of Biomedical Engineering", "https://dbe.unibas.ch/en/"], ["", "https://medizin.unibas.ch"], ["", "https://dbe.unibas.ch/en/education/phd-in-biomedical-engineering/#active-sub-nav"], ["Search", "https://dbe.unibas.ch/en/education/phd-in-biomedical-engineering/#mobile-search"], ["News & Events", "https://dbe.unibas.ch/en/events-news/"], ["News", "https